      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-06-10T19:12:23.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Regardless of what it is, you put it into play and reslove any actions that card has. If it is a one-shot, you would perform the action then move it to the trash like normal.</p><p>The distinction between \"playing\" and \"put into play\" is only important when a card effect is triggered upon one of those actions happening.</p>",
